'''Floatzel''' (Japanese: '''フローゼル''' ''Floazel'') is a {{ct|Water}} Stage 1 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Promo-A}} series of cards.

