==Release information==
This card was one of five cards that could be pulled from Promo-A Vol. 6 packs; these were made available as part of the [[Pawmot Drop Event]], which ran from April 7 to 17, 2025.

==Trivia==
===Origin===
*'''Attack the Wound''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Sword & Shield|Morpeko|78}} from the {{TCG|Sword & Shield}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

